toxic_monkey@hotmail.com (toxic_monkey@hotmail.com) wrote:
> How do I set the game to show all my scores when a character dies?  In
> the options menu there is an option called 'scores' that says I can
> set it to 'all' 'around' or 'top' but I don't know how to actually
> change the setting.

Just change it in the nethack configuration file, which is
HOME/.nethackrc on most systems and $NETHACKDIR\defaults.nh under
Windows (and DOS, I guess)

> Also, how can I view scores w/o killing a character?  Are the scores
> saved in a document somewhere so I can view all of them w/o playing?

nethack -s

